#: mixer_oss.cpp:227
msgid ""
"kmix: You do not have permission to access the mixer device.\n"
"Login as root and do a 'chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*' to allow the access."
msgstr ""
"kmix: Jy het nie toegangsreg na die menger toestel nie.\n"
"Teken in as root en doen 'chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*' om toegang te verleen."

#: mixer_oss.cpp:231
msgid ""
"kmix: Mixer cannot be found.\n"
"Please check that the soundcard is installed and the\n"
"soundcard driver is loaded.\n"
"On Linux you might need to use 'insmod' to load the driver.\n"
"Use 'soundon' when using commercial OSS."
msgstr ""
"kmix: Menger was nie gevind nie.\n"
"Asseblief bevestig dat die klankkaart geïnstalleer is en die\n"
"klankkaart drywer gelaai is.\n"
"Op Linux mag jy dalk benodig om 'insmod' te gebruik om die drywer te laai.\n"
"Gebruik 'soundon' wanneer komersiële OSS gebruik word."

